<title>USA: San Francisco approves $188 mln school, zoo bonds.</title>
<headline>San Francisco approves $188 mln school, zoo bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in San Francisco approved $188 million of bonds for schools and the city's zoo, election officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The city's voters approved the following bond measures:</p>
<p>* $140 million of bonds for San Francisco public schools and community colleges to fund construction and improvement projects.</p>
<p>* $48 million to renovate the San Francisco zoo.</p>
</text>
